{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","created_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1aafcecba604e3a6b3425e43d4e63cd4c4c1243a5eb977c0316f6985630d6282","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"onecli/onecli@3e595ef04d1a snapshot 675314da46d13fff","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_13f7794cef82a3a5e04e480bbb06c04855a35e73beb13dc0573960f12db860a2","slc_af1d51ead03b99baaa0608790bc763b267aa271444a0f0df5c65297bd8043bce"],"source_ids":["src_28895cf60b2456cd95948a7a066abde7"],"text":"Credentials are never given to agents: the gateway injects them per request, matching secrets by host and path pattern into headers or query parameters, and agents authenticate with access tokens via Proxy-Authorization headers.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","created_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4ec3ec229c4844c6806718c17320ce8c41791919b2d519f37493de1b6409bc62","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"onecli/onecli@3e595ef04d1a snapshot 675314da46d13fff","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_50e135e47fb378791b69fcdddaa37750ddb78f952a275f2aa2ecb3af8cffce2c"],"source_ids":["src_a50b9592033e5d49a45e0776f34a0570"],"text":"The codebase is a pnpm/turbo monorepo with apps (web, api-server, gateway, runner, sandbox-supervisor, ssh-terminator, channel-adapter, e2e suites) and packages (api, agent-protocol, db, ui), plus Docker Compose files for self-hosting.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","created_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6ca02f5aaf94f803bd4bf6f3575aeac290e2996dd83b1701b3738e7a52814922","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"onecli/onecli@3e595ef04d1a snapshot 675314da46d13fff","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_13f7794cef82a3a5e04e480bbb06c04855a35e73beb13dc0573960f12db860a2"],"source_ids":["src_28895cf60b2456cd95948a7a066abde7"],"text":"Agent memory is kept by the platform so it persists, and users can read and edit it at any time from the dashboard.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","created_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_78f7ed147a13da0000b6a127a2f4815f6d09a2646b96f43e3bb711526ee39989","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"onecli/onecli@3e595ef04d1a snapshot 675314da46d13fff","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0bb2a42c59303e8c1096e20f79e3dda586388cdf5742cc8d6f757a097b46cb70","slc_53acd811ab3f0b4841e31781228de692095d8c862e102550486f1453e4c9e38c","slc_89794f9da2b21ab6bcb875a679fdc90cd181e79c88f9ca2014b46fc46b69be0b"],"source_ids":["src_28895cf60b2456cd95948a7a066abde7","src_a50b9592033e5d49a45e0776f34a0570"],"text":"Repository development practice: local setup is `mise install`, `pnpm install`, `pnpm dev`, which generates .env secrets, starts PostgreSQL, applies migrations, and runs web, api, gateway and runner; `pnpm check` is the pre-push and CI gate and `pnpm test` runs test suites.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","created_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_83a09b4e49e1aeb4047c4e5fb537b39ad886445f9d366d3349c185b671d90947","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"onecli/onecli@3e595ef04d1a snapshot 675314da46d13fff","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_50e135e47fb378791b69fcdddaa37750ddb78f952a275f2aa2ecb3af8cffce2c","slc_fef4937cbfa374b22a053bd7daaea23668073a72118ffb83a3d6caadc34e0b57"],"source_ids":["src_a50b9592033e5d49a45e0776f34a0570"],"text":"Development prerequisites are mise (provisioning Node.js and pnpm), Rust for the gateway, and Docker for PostgreSQL and agent sandboxes; the stack uses Prisma ORM with PostgreSQL.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","created_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_98b16239a052c95aeebc96a92a50232eaf733deb37c40bc0272cf6d3e17ebae9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"onecli/onecli@3e595ef04d1a snapshot 675314da46d13fff","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_14c94fcdf07dd094a2f24837f00e105ee3d8bea7496927754484476d0e13a162"],"source_ids":["src_655f57cebedd53cc980f44d4c8749d1d"],"text":"Self-hosted upgrades must not use a bare `docker compose pull && up -d`, because the agent sandbox image is set via RUNNER_AGENT_IMAGE on the runner service and would silently stay stale while other services update.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","created_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9da261786b514d052e4c5b44818fc4aa5c68cd1cbac8420f9bbc3a0f702c68c6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"onecli/onecli@3e595ef04d1a snapshot 675314da46d13fff","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_af1d51ead03b99baaa0608790bc763b267aa271444a0f0df5c65297bd8043bce"],"source_ids":["src_28895cf60b2456cd95948a7a066abde7"],"text":"The runner starts, parks and reaps agent sandboxes, polls a work queue owned by the API server, and never touches the database directly.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","created_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a686b8a5402d83443b13188e2d5f894af99a4e81e00d6e52cea6a5c4169312a2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"onecli/onecli@3e595ef04d1a snapshot 675314da46d13fff","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0e8d4c6f0f0970e438bb79f7c530db98858c1f1dd35431c15fe9e23b596d7408","slc_13f7794cef82a3a5e04e480bbb06c04855a35e73beb13dc0573960f12db860a2"],"source_ids":["src_28895cf60b2456cd95948a7a066abde7","src_bdf53833e9bb5525a6662d8e5e2a4378"],"text":"Each agent can have its own Slack app answering in channels and DMs under its own name; a DM shares the same conversation as the web dashboard, and gateway approvals appear as Slack cards with Approve/Deny buttons.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","created_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d4b8cc091be8782a24b9a52609eb9151e9d46fb8f72a10f4309ec48af2f0334d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"onecli/onecli@3e595ef04d1a snapshot 675314da46d13fff","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_13f7794cef82a3a5e04e480bbb06c04855a35e73beb13dc0573960f12db860a2","slc_e2f94c7b4d8193f8fafb89d1f3944e93e5231596e12791d09b5c4af16d4166bf"],"source_ids":["src_28895cf60b2456cd95948a7a066abde7"],"text":"Agents run in isolated sandboxes whose only network egress is the gateway, so they can reach only granted resources; the runner is outbound-only with no inbound ports, enabling NAT'd hosts without ingress or tunnels.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","created_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e8ef9c3b9376c86d199a7a71036e552f4cb129bbd512f9f2a7bfc1d13d2c8645","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"onecli/onecli@3e595ef04d1a snapshot 675314da46d13fff","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c05898bc2c726c1550feaffa00c0e2b74ebf4ea2934d58b74635c908cba85e5b","slc_e0e4c03423e63e2a0c7224b64ffd4babb1880877a7301aa13bf14e077f8991d6","slc_fd1afbf263e448f83d7252c19c56a107cddc82b92d7b8904873b44e09dc3026a"],"source_ids":["src_28895cf60b2456cd95948a7a066abde7","src_2e2bc7512d53526585da214cdaeda8e5"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributions require reading the Contributing Guide and Code of Conduct and are accepted under a Contributor License Agreement with ChartDB, Inc., signable via the CLA Assistant flow on a pull request.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:25:50Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a17826486fe84a1b884b51352ff5dda0"}
